# The Emissary San d'Oria at Chateau d'Oraguille with ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1 and neither Halver's spell nor his cipher
# (the login's onZoneIn returns nothing). Halver at status 0 and at status 2 (a GM): nothing from the mission; at
# status 3: 501 (parameter 7 is 1), whose finish moves to status 4 and gives Halver's cipher; at status 4:
# HALVER_OFFSET + 266, a message.
lists ChateauDoraguille/Halver/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/501 GhelsbaOutpost/Warchief_Vatgit/onMobDeath NorthernSanDoria/Baraka/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Helaku/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Shakir/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/536 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/543
char zone=ChateauDoraguille pos=2,0.1,0.1 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheEmissarySandoria current
setting ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1
login
trigger Halver
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 2
trigger Halver
finish-if-event
missionstatus Bastok 3
trigger Halver
finish
trigger Halver
finish-if-event
